-- Gen2Rev challenge ingest: Ezekiel (World 26) and Daniel (World 27)
-- Generated from docs/content/ezekiel.md and docs/content/daniel.md
-- Both books: theological review approved-with-changes, verbatim QA pass
-- (docs/CONTENT_REVIEW_LOG.md rows 26-27, docs/QA_SIGNOFF.md)
-- Ezekiel 16, 23, 38, 39 and Daniel 7-12 are permanently excluded per each book's brief;
